<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HASSAM NEXUS</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    background: #050816;
    color: white;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

header {
    padding: 25px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #164e63;
}

header h1 {
    color: #00e5ff;
    font-size: 32px;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
}

.hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 85px 15px;
}

.hero h2 {
    font-size: 42px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.hero span {
    color: #00e5ff;
}

.hero p {
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 17px;
}

.cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 25px;
}

.card {
    background: #101b35;
    border: 1px solid #164e63;
    border-radius: 15px;
    padding: 30px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    border-color: #00e5ff;
}

.card h3 {
    color: #00e5ff;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.card p {
    color: #bbb;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px;
    color: #777;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>HASSAM NEXUS</h1>
    <p>THE FUTURE STARTS HERE</p>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <h2>WELCOME TO <span>NEXUS</span></h2>
    <p>Your Personal Digital Universe.</p>
</section>

<section class="cards">

<div class="card">
<h3>🤖 NEXUS AI</h3>
<p>Your intelligent AI assistant.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🌌 HOLO SPACE</h3>
<p>Explore a futuristic digital space.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🎨 DREAM ENGINE</h3>
<p>Turn creative ideas into reality.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🎙️ VOICE COMMAND</h3>
<p>Control your digital universe.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🧠 SMART MEMORY</h3>
<p>Save your important notes.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🧪 FUTURE LAB</h3>
<p>Discover new digital tools.</p>
</div>

</section>

<footer>
MADE WITH ❤️ BY HASSAM JUTT
</footer>

</body>
</html>
